---
<svg class:list={['arrow-icon shrink-0', name === 'arrow' && 'arrow', cls]} width={size} height={size} viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="square" aria-hidden="true"><path d={paths[name]} /></svg>
